Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The proof reconstructs to `#Top` and is non-vacuous, but it proves a manually constructed call state rather than executing `solution.mpy`. Mutating the submitted program’s body leaves the proof at `#Top`, demonstrating the missing program connection.

